I don't know how to diagnose your problems, but when we moved our Tru64
cluster from a RA8000 to MA8000 RAID system, we just used addvol to add
the new root/usr/... areas from the MA and then rmvol to remove the old
ones form the RA. Do that with all the storage and we only had to drop
each server out of the cluster once to reconfigure the bootdef_dev
fibre-channel mappings.

Matthew


